Z||000000||Flamberge||11-05-2001||02:41 AM||||I am SICK of getting upwardsof 250 emails *a day* at my home email addy, and all of it (about 99.2%) is either spam or spam/porn. I despise junk email and was wondering if anyone knows a way to block it at the source (the server.) The spammers use multiple (countless) email addresses to spam, so I can't block just one. Is there shareware, freeware, etc that can fix this? I already use the "email message rules" and "add to junksender's list/adult content list" in Outlook, but obviously it doesn't help much... so...<P>Help? Thanks in advance.<P><P>------------------<BR>- Flamberge<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://flamberge.iwarp.com/Serra3sm.jpg"> ||||reg||8
